{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02989","headline":"感遇十二首 一 · 张九龄","name":"感遇十二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰叶春葳蕤，桂华秋皎洁。\n欣欣此生意，自尔爲佳节。\n谁知林栖者，闻风坐相悦。\n草木有本心，何求美人折。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「感遇十二首」条，撰者管遗瑞、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"管遗瑞"}